  "Separate <b>fixed holidays</b> (everyone off) from <b>restricted or optional holidays</b> (each employee picks a set number).",
  "Restricted holidays are how a diverse team gets to observe what actually matters to them without inflating the total.",
  "National holidays are common to all states; the rest vary — build per-location lists if you operate in more than one state.",
  "Every published holiday must exist in the system that calculates payable days, or the calendar and payroll will disagree.",
