  "Compare a <b>similar past task</b> to the one you're estimating — historical comparison beats fresh reasoning almost every time.",
  "Track your team's <b>estimate-to-actual ratio</b> and apply it as a correction factor. If you consistently run 1.6×, plan at 1.6×.",
